## SQ-WO-25 | trust is per player
> setblock 550 -60 300 mysticaloaktree:wise_oak
> wiseoak trust 550 -60 300 G 100
> wiseoak trust 550 -60 300 H 0
> pbot use H 550 -60 300 up
> wiseoak trust 550 -60 300 H
> wiseoak trust 550 -60 300 G
> zwo drops 550 -60 300 3
